### Login -> Creates a Row in `sessions` Table & Returns JWT
### Expected: 200 OK with { token, username, name }.
### Action: Copy the returned `token` value into `@token` above before Steps 3-7.
### Verify in psql: SELECT * FROM sessions; (should see 1 new row for this user).
# @name login
